==== Installing OpenWrt ====

{{:meta:icons:tango:48px-dialog-warning.svg.png?nolink&20x20}} In the rare case you were using the old experimental firmware from this wiki (pre 2021-05), please follow the instructions [[#Revert from old experimental firmware|here]]

